# Optional local wheelhouse for the unified-runtime image build.
#
# The Dockerfile bind-mounts this directory and passes it to pip as
# --find-links, so any wheel dropped here is installed from disk instead of
# being downloaded. This matters most for torch (~2.2GB), which is unreliable
# to pull over a slow link.
#
# Leaving the directory empty is fully supported: pip simply finds no local
# candidate and downloads from the index as normal. That is what happens on a
# fresh server (e.g. the MCU deploy). The directory itself must exist on every
# machine, because the Dockerfile bind-mounts it — which is why this file is
# committed rather than a bare .gitkeep.
#
# Wheels themselves must never be committed.
*.whl
